sequenceDiagram
  participant Server
  participant Browser
  participant CasLink as Cas Link
  Server->>Server: Generate CSRF state
  Server->>Server: POST /grant/token
  Server-->>Browser: grantToken, redirectUri, state
  Browser->>CasLink: Open link
  CasLink-->>Browser: publicToken + state
  Browser->>Server: Exchange publicToken
  Server->>Server: Store grantId and accessToken securely
